  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "──一足先に、試写を拝見しました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "これまで有栖川さんはあまり\r\nお芝居をされてこなかったと後から聞いて、驚きました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040130060",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『演技をしている有栖川夏葉』ではなく\r\nその世界のひとりになれるようにと思っていたので",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そう言っていただけて嬉しいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "──それだけ、今回の役柄が合っていたのかもしれません\r\nご自分ではどう感じますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "現場でも、『役のイメージに合っている』と\r\n言っていただけたのですが",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私自身はあまり、そうは思っていませんでした",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "──では、ご自分と役のどんなところが\r\n違うと感じられていましたか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "はい、私は上京するに当たっても、\r\nこうして、芸能の活動をするにしても",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "周りの方に応援していただくことが多く、\r\nあまり反対されたことは無いんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "今回の役どころは、両親の反対を受けても\r\n地元を飛び出して外へと向かう奔放な女性でしたが",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "自分自身にあまり、そういった経験が無かったので\r\n演じるのがとても難しかったです",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "──なるほど、そうだったんですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "『意志の強さ』のようなものを、役を通して\r\n有栖川さんからも感じたように思います",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "何か意識をして演じられましたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "反対を受けること……両親や、故郷への反抗心が\r\n彼女を強くし、行動させているのだとしたら",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私は逆に、家族を含めファンのみなさんや\r\nスタッフの方々に応援していただけているということが",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私を強くしてくれているのではないかと思います",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012040130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "真逆ですが、それぞれの『意志の強さ』が\r\n上手く重なったのかもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301204/2013012040130"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2200
  },
  {
